---
layout: base.njk
title: Blogs | Bloogsite
description: Browse every Bloogsite category and discover the newest and most useful guides across technology, finance, careers, health, travel, and modern life.
activeNav: blogs
permalink: /blogs/
---
{% from "article-card.njk" import articleCard %}

<main class="blog-index" id="main-content">
<header class="blog-index-header"><p class="section-kicker">The Bloogsite library</p><h1>Blogs</h1><p>Clear, practical guides for the subjects shaping your work, money, wellbeing, and everyday life.</p></header>

<nav class="blog-filter-list" aria-label="Blog categories"><a class="active" href="/blogs/">All blogs</a>{% for cat in categories %}<a href="/categories/{{ cat.slug }}/">{{ cat.name }}</a>{% endfor %}</nav>

{% if collections.topArticles.length %}
<section class="blog-index-section" aria-labelledby="top-articles-title"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="section-kicker">Reader essentials</p><h2 id="top-articles-title">Top articles</h2></div></div><div class="blogs blog-index-grid">{% for post in collections.topArticles %}{{ articleCard(post, categories) }}{% endfor %}</div></section>
{% endif %}

<section class="blog-index-section" aria-labelledby="new-articles-title"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="section-kicker">Recently published</p><h2 id="new-articles-title">New articles</h2></div></div>
{% if collections.posts.length %}<div class="blogs blog-index-grid">{% for post in collections.posts %}{{ articleCard(post, categories) }}{% endfor %}</div>{% else %}<div class="blog-empty-state"><h3>The library is being prepared.</h3><p>New practical guides will appear here as soon as they complete editorial review.</p><a href="/about/">Read our editorial mission →</a></div>{% endif %}</section>
</main>
